    "Plot minterms (1s) and don't-care conditions (Xs) on a 4-variable K-Map.",
    "Notice that minterms 1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 11, 13, 15 plus don't cares 0, 2, 8, 10 allow a full 8-cell or 16-cell octet grouping, reducing F directly to D.",
